 "headline": "Flagg Detonates While Brookyn Sleepwalks Through Midnight",
 "notes": [
  "Cooper Flagg has 32 points, 5 steals and 4 blocks for Suggs to be you, and Zero Fox Given is watching an 8-3 lead form.",
  "Scottie Barnes dropped 34 on 11-of-20 shooting for MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f, and they still trail Thug Life 5-6 right now. Somebody else is stinking.",
  "Immanuel Quickley has 24 points, 10 boards and 14 assists for Adam Silver Dez Nuts, and DREB is the only thing between them and a 7-4 deficit rescue.",
  "BrookynDynasty ranks dead last tonight and still leads Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw 8-3. Austin Reaves is a bad shooter wearing a good contract.",
  "Ja'Kobe Walter went 0-for-6 for LeParth James and Keldon Johnson shot 1-for-6 for Nova Knicks. Their 6-5 matchup hinges on DREB, and neither helped."
 ],
