   {
    "team": "Thug Life",
    "line": "Jeremiah Fears went 2-for-11 tonight, yet Thug Life still leads MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f. The manager is lucky, and Rui Hachimura is swinging a matchup."
   },
   {
    "team": "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw",
    "line": "Down 3-8 with OREB as the only swing category, Austin Reaves went 3-for-9 for 8 points. That is the whole season in one line."
